{"unit_id":"thomasvvugt__dsh-wide-stats-footer#card-zh","repo":"thomasvvugt/dsh-wide-stats-footer","commit":"fe4e6f6ce4fb86067a2ab4bb9087ec2d622b182c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wide-stats-footer 是一款 DSH 网页插件，通过浏览器端插件层发现统计栏的 CSS 模块并覆盖其最大宽度和左右内边距，让回合数、步骤数、模型耗时、首 token 时间、缓存命中率及 token 统计横跨完整输入区显示。它同时用样式规则和 DOM 内联样式处理已有及后续挂载的统计栏，并在样式或页面变化时重新同步。适合希望在宽屏上完整查看 DSH 会话统计的网页用户；无需额外密钥或服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4-11","client.js:184-229"]}
{"unit_id":"thomasvvugt__dsh-wide-stats-footer#card-en","repo":"thomasvvugt/dsh-wide-stats-footer","commit":"fe4e6f6ce4fb86067a2ab4bb9087ec2d622b182c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wide-stats-footer widens the DSH web stats footer by discovering its CSS module and removing the width clamp and side padding. Session counts, timing, cache and token stats can use the full composer width. It reapplies the change as views mount; no extra key or service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:4-11","client.js:184-229"]}
